    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v9.0 dataset consists of spatial point data with attribute information. The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v8.0 . The following changes were made: The data for Haut-Katanga, Haut-Lomami, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema, and Tanganyika provinces were updated. Dataset citation: Center for Integrated Earth System Information (CIESIN), Columbia University, Ministère de la Santé Publique, Hygiène et Prévention, Democratic Republic of the Congo, and GRID3. 2026. GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v9.0. New York: Columbia University. https://doi.org/10.7916/77t0-h465. Accessed [DAY MONTH YEAR]. Contacts and data queries: The authors of this dataset appreciate feedback regarding the data, including suggestions, discovery of errors, difficulties in using the data, and format preferences. For dataset-related questions, please send an email to: info@ciesin.columbia.edu",
